---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Imprint / Impressum — PrintHub">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Imprint / Impressum</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">According to § 5 TMG (German law)</p>

    <div class="prose prose-slate mt-6 max-w-none text-slate-700">
      <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">Operator</h2>
      <address class="not-italic">
        Demo Print GmbH<br>
        Druckereistraße 12<br>
        10115 Berlin<br>
        Germany
      </address>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Email: <a href="mailto:hello@demoprint.example" class="text-indigo-600 underline">hello@demoprint.example</a><br>
        Phone: +49 30 1234 5678
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">Registration</h2>
      <p>
        HRB 123456, Amtsgericht Berlin (Charlottenburg)<br>
        Managing director: Erika Musterfrau<br>
        VAT ID: DE123456789
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">Online dispute resolution</h2>
      <p>
        The European Commission provides a platform for online dispute resolution at
        <a href="https://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr" class="text-indigo-600 underline" rel="noopener">ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr</a>.
        We are not obliged or willing to participate in dispute resolution proceedings before a consumer arbitration board.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">Liability for content</h2>
      <p>
        As a service provider we are responsible for our own content on these pages under the general laws (§ 7 TMG).
        We are not obliged to monitor transmitted or stored third-party information (§§ 8–10 TMG).
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
